{"title":"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/4680de5c7f9ab9bc5aa9202554728141f0755623.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1},a_{2},a_{3},\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"11\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/5/3458a1d9def9933895989162897325dab47d815e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1} = 19,a_{9} = 99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />, and, for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811f76ab716762dc2652ba611378a1816b671893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd28b278a07bda0ea4d08737743613980c6aa6a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> is the arithmetic mean of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e80c6b6a84ad4015ea436a915435d69edbdd96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> terms.  Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1cc94d376e1bf3e6cccc18ce184cb2326f07c72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{(A)} \\ 29 \\qquad \\textrm{(B)} \\ 59 \\qquad \\textrm{(C)} \\ 79 \\qquad \\textrm{(D)} \\ 99 \\qquad \\textrm{(E)} \\ 179$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"384\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />. We can then write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/7/527b9cdbb0353c8b3ea287ae39f6c537271d1588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=m-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f72964790f8b9dbc76db5732b351cf2b9d2fe161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=m+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>By definition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03def77ce58a6b3eaab71296c872a2e5c35e0402.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3=m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e28850813a5321d2a8ae3c0510457a7337975ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> is the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4055ab0aee76f05e92ef233fdd7c52b9384f6a93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5a083e7f191a719575c44f1a6e31fd2f8b8506.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, which is again <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p><p>Realizing this, one can easily prove by induction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bc255492bb978426253356c7af95f2b55cc3876.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall n\\geq 3;~ a_n=m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfd67409937fe2883c8a3b73999b1f4c87e80eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=a_9=99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afa00279b1eac86ac500c8745ebd4d7f6c298676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19=a_1=m-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"17\" /> we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809d1f651ebe2560380b4047858d9087cb615073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=80$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />. And thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb4fb34cc1223258e82a7b6f46f70f6f03497d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = m+x = \\boxed{(E)  179}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"181\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/58488fe7417bd8f77addd0093869b2f34bce7896.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdc3896ef2c91df3d06cf19259c9d2f57215f74b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff959eca2c7caf727a5a9d7946ca5e82a5ccfd55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3=\\frac{a+b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/16972e6f28912333c6ca7081500511ea29f278d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4=\\frac{a+b+\\frac{a+b}{2}}{3}=\\frac{a+b}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"43\" /> and so on.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/c/46cf2f923bdb3cb653718ef20c798f754f71a408.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3=a_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/6/216cf6360457e2cb52a8b24ec0672eebda374cce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=a_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/29026b10d3ca67a0c4cbfc60e8d2ee96f02c2a9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/2/8b2a96b62040efdef580163b2e7f183aa6e79ac6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_9=\\frac{a_1+a_2}{2}=\\frac{a+b}{2}=99, a+b=198.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"318\" height=\"39\" /> We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69b02ffbf9d03ea51c46bfc7b6acddfffd6c172e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=a=19.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca28400a51e041046511cdad00e6734735c4ba8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$198,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"31\" height=\"16\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/7/9d7c2157079e3b555ceb9b5018103d8cac15fb60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=a_2=\\boxed{(E)  179}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"147\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~Benedict T (countmath1)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME\" title=\"1999 AHSME\">1999 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192130\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 251/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6580/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.076      1 -total\n 57.28%    6.917      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 40.21%    4.856      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7608:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017192130 and revision id 191146. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}